72
00:05:59,838 --> 00:06:02,838
But, everyone on my squad feels the same.

73
00:06:02,838 --> 00:06:04,838
We're with you 100%.

74
00:06:04,838 --> 00:06:10,838
We may be noobs, but we'll follow our directives and try our best not to drag anyone down.

75
00:06:10,838 --> 00:06:12,838
I swear this on my honor and my life.

76
00:06:12,838 --> 00:06:14,838
