186
00:10:02,838 --> 00:10:03,838
Blood of the highest quality.

187
00:10:03,838 --> 00:10:04,838
Perfection.

188
00:10:04,838 --> 00:10:06,838
It should be savored while it's fresh.

189
00:10:06,838 --> 00:10:08,838
Please, enjoy yourself.

190
00:10:08,838 --> 00:10:11,838
I'll try it once we've returned to the compound.

191
00:10:11,838 --> 00:10:12,838
Very well.

192
00:10:14,838 --> 00:10:15,838
